  <data name="ConnectionDetailsHostBody" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Host bụ adreesị ngwaọrụ ebe FTPS Server na-agba.
Họrọ adreesị IP. Aha ngwaọrụ na-arụ ọrụ naanị ma netwọkụ nwere ike dozie ya.

Jiri otu n'ime ndị a:</value>
